# Strategy Pattern — Calculator

A simple Java implementation of the Strategy design pattern using JDK 17.

## Features
- Addition
- Subtraction
- Multiplication
- Runtime strategy switching

## How to Run
Open the project in IntelliJ IDEA and run `Main.java`.

## Structure
- `OperationStrategy` — interface
- `AddStrategy`, `SubtractStrategy`, `MultiplyStrategy` — concrete strategies
- `Calculator` — context
- `Main` — client

## Adding a Strategy
Implement `OperationStrategy` and pass the new strategy to `Calculator` using `setStrategy()`.
